<Content
  title="Cookies"
  path="/cookies"
  description="isithot.today sets no cookies of its own. Advertising and consent cookies are set only with your choice."
>
  <h1>Cookies</h1>
  <p>
    <em>Draft for review. Last updated 6 October 2026.</em>
  </p>
  <p>
    isithot.today does not set any cookies of its own, and we do not use analytics cookies. Traffic
    is counted with Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookieless.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and consent cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The site shows one advert from Google AdSense. In the UK and EEA, a consent banner from Google's
    certified consent platform asks before any advertising cookies are used or personalised adverts
    are shown. Google sets a cookie to remember your choice. If you decline, Google may still show a
    non-personalised advert.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can change your choice at any time from the "Privacy and cookie settings" link that the
    consent banner adds to the page, or by clearing cookies for this site in your browser.
  </p>

  <h2>Local storage</h2>
  <p>
    We use your browser's local storage (not a cookie) to remember your last place, your °C/°F
    choice and the last answer. It stays on your device. See our{' '}
    <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a>.
  </p>
</Content>
